  "question": {
    "text": "A reservoir is at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>827</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&deg;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and Carnot&#39;s engine takes a thousand <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kilo</mi><mi>calorie</mi></math>&nbsp;of heat from it and exhausts it to a sink at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&deg;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. What is the amount of work and the efficiency of the engine?"
